[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7080.55, "timestamp": "01:58:00", "text": "奥内克西亚（Onexia）大概就是这个意思吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7082.95, "timestamp": "01:58:02", "text": "所以从某种意义上说，厌食症就像一个仓库"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7085.75, "timestamp": "01:58:05", "text": "我想做的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7087.99, "timestamp": "01:58:07", "text": "但我意识到我无法正确地做到这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7089.99, "timestamp": "01:58:09", "text": "现在因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7094.39, "timestamp": "01:58:14", "text": "我的梦想逐渐演变成更大的梦想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7097.669, "timestamp": "01:58:17", "text": "随着时间的推移，事情会变得越来越大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7099.83, "timestamp": "01:58:19", "text": "虽然最初应该是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7102.55, "timestamp": "01:58:22", "text": "原本应该是广播节目的名字 onx 是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7105.83, "timestamp": "01:58:25", "text": "初始名称，然后是 onx 呃，名称"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7108.47, "timestamp": "01:58:28", "text": "我得到它的方式就像我当时正在打字一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7111.83, "timestamp": "01:58:31", "text": "空气，我不小心写成了X。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7115.27, "timestamp": "01:58:35", "text": "R。我当时想，“哦，Onyx 实际上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7118.31, "timestamp": "01:58:38", "text": "好的。真是个好听的新名字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7122.79, "timestamp": "01:58:42", "text": "所以，最初我的社区是因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7125.669, "timestamp": "01:58:45", "text": "没能成功做成广播节目。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7128.149, "timestamp": "01:58:48", "text": "因为马丁·加里克·哈德威尔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7129.99, "timestamp": "01:58:49", "text": "那些大牌DJ都有自己的电台"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7132.709, "timestamp": "01:58:52", "text": "每周的节目都会播出，他们会根据新的内容进行表演。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7135.189, "timestamp": "01:58:55", "text": "曲调和他们自己的音乐，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7138.55, "timestamp": "01:58:58", "text": "诸如此类的东西也可以上传到……"}]